### listar todas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories

### obtener una (Placas de Video, del seed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories/674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345

### id inválido
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories/no-es-un-id

### crear
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Almacenamiento",
  "description": "Discos SSD, HDD y pendrives"
}

### crear sin nombre
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Sin nombre"
}

### modificar (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/categories/674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012347
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Periféricos",
  "description": "Teclados, mouses, auriculares y webcams"
}

### modificar parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/categories/674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012347
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Teclados, mouses y auriculares"
}

### eliminar con productos asociados (409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/categories/674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345
